  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You know that anything can be a bludgeon if you hold it just right.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bludgeoner<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You take no penalty on attack rolls when you use any melee weapon (including improvised weapons) to deal nonlethal damage. When dealing nonlethal damage with a bludgeoning weapon, add one-half your mythic tier to your damage roll (minimum 1), and if you confirm a critical hit you can expend one use of mythic power to apply the effects of the Staggering Critical feat. If you are at least 6th tier, you can expend two uses of mythic power to apply the effects of Stunning Critical.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
